# Dashboard `/`

- DB-backed KPIs only: total, open, completed, overdue WorkItems and logged hours for the selected period. Remove sample arrays from `app/page.tsx` / `dashboard-charts.tsx`.
- Lists: recent, urgent, and overdue rows show Project, Customer, functional role, status, and due date. Assignee is the sole owner.
- Recent Projects show Customer plus the shared progress formula (completed ÷ (total − cancelled)).
- Clickable cards and charts deep-link to the source list with the same filters that produced the number.
- Show period, Asia/Bangkok timezone, and metric definitions on the page. Empty state when no rows — never fake zeros as live data.
- Default period/year and all business-date boundaries use the system default `Asia/Bangkok`, independent of browser or server timezone.
- Target read: `GET /api/dashboard/summary`. Shared query modules, not page-local math. Include filter/formula metadata in the response.
- Charts stay inside the component frame (`STAT_GRID`, `min-width: 0`). No page-level horizontal overflow.
- Out: notification center, forecasting, configurable builder, cross-company BI.
